      "path": "/sections/0/components/1/props/columns/1/selection/writes/region/level",
      "message": "表格单元格选择显式写入目标筛选层级 由 6.95 引入，文档声明的是 6.90"
    },
    {
      "type": "SCHEMA_ERROR",
      "path": "/sections/0/components/0/props/components",
